WEBVTT

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:23.820
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:31.170
<i>I still want to keep feeling my</i>
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:38.900
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.750
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:57.520
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:12.430
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:20.100
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:44.030
Another fine day
for work!

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:44.540
Hmm?

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:49.110
Up! Up you go. Come
on. Ouch.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:05.660
Feels like somebody's
watching me.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.090
Naw, that's
ridiculous.

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:13.530
Come on. Up, you go. Pretty
please? Come on, zipper.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:18.570
FILE. 43
8OKUTO STATION
SCANDAL

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.600
You feel like you're
being watched?

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.540
When I turn around, there's
nobody there.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:29.080
But I tell you, for the last two or three days
it's felt like someone's been watching me.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:35.110
Yeah, I had the same feeling when
I was working on the car.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.520
Have you noticed anything, Aoi?

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.650
Have you noticed anything, Aoi?
No, not especially.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:43.260
It's your mind playing tricks on you. The
heat's melting your brain. Like this...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.700
It's nothing like that!

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:45.900
Huh?

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:49.360
We'd better check it out. Because maybe...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.870
It's a stalker!

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:55.360
Hmm? Don't be such a nitwit.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.040
You never know.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.350
Chief.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:01.750
I just had the feeling I was being watched.

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:05.720
I'm almost certain that someone's
been spying on Bokuto Station.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.350
Chief?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.510
Yes?

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:15.420
I'd like to ask a question that I'm sure
everyone else here is wondering.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.150
Mm-hmm!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:22.130
Is there any link between this peeping
Tom and those track pants of yours?

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.930
No comment.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:32.500
I'll just say that all of my trousers
are at the cleaners.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.730
We're running behind.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.330
Yeah. Better hurry and...

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.900
What is it,
Miyuki?

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.540
Did you hear something
just now?

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:02.680
What, now?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.510
Yeah.

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:14.020
"Strawberry Bank Robbery Investigation HQ"

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:18.890
Hey!

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.760
You working out in this heat?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.830
Or are you moving?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.300
No, and no.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.760
Any leads on
the robbery?

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:35.940
No. All we know is that he got
away in a blue Primera.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:41.780
The case's keeping me so busy, I forgot my
kid's birthday. My wife skinned me alive.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.910
Here's a photo from the
surveillance camera.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.120
Detective...

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:56.130
With that get-up and your serious face,
you really do look like a creep.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.130
Let me tell you
about creeps.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.840
Mumbling on
every day...

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:11.070
Every day I keep wondering if there's
something missing. Good morning!

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.310
What's up?

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:15.710
What's up?
Hi, Natsumi. Got a weird fax this morning.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.440
What do you mean
by that?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:24.920
"It's a riot! Check out the hot
news at Bokuto Station."

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.460
Here it is!

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:28.330
Here it is!
Aah!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.930
Hey!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:38.360
"Bokuto Station Happy-Happy Diary"

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:42.830
I knew I heard something! They shot these
using a remote control helicopter.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:47.770
We shouldn't be taking this lightly!
We're all over the Internet!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.330
That can be accessed across the world?

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.200
Yes.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:12.200
Right now there are probably people in Rio
de Janeiro looking at your photo, Chief!

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.770
You're so inter-
national, Chief!

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.140
Rio de Janeiro?

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:23.210
They took a picture of me
stepping in dog poop?!

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.450
This is ludicrous! Who's responsible?!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.390
Some creep's behind it, for sure!

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:30.160
Yeah, you're right!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.930
Hang on, now. You don't know it's a man.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.590
Yeah, that's reverse sexual harassment!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.230
All right. Good. Go
right, Shunji.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.200
Okay.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.840
Yoshiki. Click the shutter.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.330
Here goes.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:52.910
What? That's
me! Cool!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.950
This says you lift
25 kilo weights.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:03.180
I can lift 30 kilos,
no problem!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.720
Well I carried forty kilos
on each side, once.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.290
Wanna compete, then? There's some
even heavier things out back!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:15.660
Excuse me. But I don't think the issue
here is which one of you is stronger.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.160
She's right. We've got to find out
who's behind this, and fast.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.850
They didn't see us, did they?

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.820
They didn't see us, did they?
No way. We're safe.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.650
Let's upload
that photo.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:38.380
It'd be nice if it didn't take a whole
30 seconds to upload.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:43.450
Yeah, well that's as fast as it's going
to get using this operating system.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.400
Rio de Janeiro.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.660
"Oh My God!"

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:57.670
"Eyaaah!"

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:01.680
"lnspection interrupted?"

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:11.020
Boy is this addictive. Everyone in
town's talking about it.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.350
Good idea,
Keita.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:17.760
I just want people to know that the
cops there are really approachable.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.890
Look how interesting they are
when they're not in public.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:23.700
I just hope they
don't catch us.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:28.430
Don't worry about it. We're helping
them improve their image!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:31.300
Duck!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.780
I could swear someone's
watching me.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.820
"First Job in the Morning"

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.790
Boy!

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.100
You're sure going at it.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.200
Detective!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.930
You're at it late!

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.200
Here's some food.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.070
Thanks, Detective!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.470
You didn't
have to.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:05.540
The photo analysis hasn't
resulted in much.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.340
Speaking of
which...

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:12.890
I can't go outside, thanks to those photos.
It's like I'm a celebrity, or something.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.590
You mean on the website? Can't
we contact the service provider?

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:22.090
They won't give us any info. They say they
have to protect their client's privacy.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:27.860
That's probably true, but still, they might
cooperate if we lean on them a bit.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.640
Huh? What's this?

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:33.200
Huh? What's this?
It's a photo we printed out.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.370
What is it, Detective?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.780
Look at this.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.750
Look at this.
Hmm? Oh!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:43.540
That's Nakajima stepping
in some poop!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.390
Give me a break, please!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.920
A blue Primera!

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.020
Hmm?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.920
And look at this man.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.890
Hey, what's
going on?

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:01.930
You've got that photo of the thief, from
the surveillance camera, don't you?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.900
Here it is.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:08.810
The thief used a blue Primera to get away.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:08.940
Here it is.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:14.350
Similar looks. Similar clothes. Yes, it
really does look like the same man.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:22.610
Nakajima. When was it that you stepped
in that poop, in front of that bank?

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.950
Huh? How should
I know?

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:29.430
Try to think back. It's
an important clue.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:31.820
Yeah. When
was it?

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:34.870
Uh, I can't
be sure...

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:40.710
No doubt about it. Nakajima put his foot
in it the day before the robbery.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:42.910
That's right!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.040
Huh?

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:47.240
Nakajima, you heard the
news, and said...

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:50.150
"Yesterday I stepped in poop there,
and today the place gets robbed..."

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:53.050
"Nothing good happens at
the Strawberry Bank."

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:56.020
I heard you say
it, too.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:00.220
The photo was taken the day before, when
he came to case the bank.

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:06.530
If we can get the original, we can do a plate
search and dig up his photograph.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:10.600
This website has become very
popular here in town.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:13.260
If the thief happens to
see this picture...

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.810
That'd mean
trouble.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:20.810
We've got to find the person who took the
picture and see that they take it down.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.200
What is he doing?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:43.890
Not again!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.940
His zipper is stuck!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.740
again!

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.970
It's weird,
though.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:57.070
The newspapers say these guys are so
busy solving one case after another.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.810
That's why it's cool, seeing their other
side. Come on, Chief, you can do it!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:05.190
One more
picture.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.220
Gotcha, little
Rio.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.530
They caught us!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.770
Shunji! Bring the helicopter back.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:48.390
Got it.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:49.740
It's getting away.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.970
That's what we want it to do. Let's go!

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:54.370
Right behind you!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:16.190
I'll keep you informed of the target's
location... over the radio.

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:18.960
If we get stuck in traffic,
you follow it!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:19.930
Roger!

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:20.370
"Traffic"

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.930
People's lives are depending
on this.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.340
Yes, that's correct.
I appreciate it.

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:29.700
We found something.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:32.410
Tsujimoto and Kobayakawa are in pursuit.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:37.010
Thanks. I was just talking with the ISP.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:42.580
The website domain belongs to Keita Fukagawa.
A junior high student from around here.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:46.390
What a hassle. That took
two hours to find out.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.800
Did you threaten them?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.730
Don't be silly.

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.590
I beg your
pardon...

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:56.400
I think we should back up
Officer Tsujimoto, sir.

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:58.100
You're right.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.070
Good luck.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:06.480
You and zippers just don't
hit it off, do you?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:12.680
I think one of my ancestors
once tortured a zipper.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:13.820
Chief.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.660
Hmm?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.420
That color looks good on you.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.480
Think so?

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:30.100
Still going
straight.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.700
We've learned the name of the
owner of the website.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:37.400
Keita Fukagawa, fifteen years old, in junior
high. Lives in Sumida District at...

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.440
Hot day,
huh?

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.310
Who are
you?

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:50.420
You're the ones who put up that website
about Bokuto Station, aren't you?

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.790
Roger.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:58.060
Miyuki!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:03.130
Yeah. I don't have a good feeling
about this. We'd better hurry.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.410
Are you a cop?

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.370
Uh... Sure.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.640
Damn. Caught
already.

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:17.650
I didn't come here to arrest you or
anything. Anyway, you're minors.

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:18.990
Let's see your badge.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:20.120
Uh...

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:23.150
Yeah, that's right! Let's see your badge!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:33.320
Here's my
badge.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.270
I want one of the pictures
you took.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.640
How much further is
that thing going?!

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:50.610
He lives around here, so probably
not much more.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:56.780
Give me the negatives for all the photos
you put up on your website.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.150
The photos?

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:02.950
They're digital. They don't
have negatives.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:05.360
No negatives?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.370
Don't you know anything
about digital cameras?

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.100
Shut up!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:18.400
What's that? What
is that thing?!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.040
That's the remote control helicopter
that takes the pictures.

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:26.170
Ha! That must be where the negatives
are. Bring it down!

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:28.620
You don't understand.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:31.590
Oh, no!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.490
The cops!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:34.730
Damn you!

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:36.920
You don't understand.

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.530
There they are!

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:41.360
Who's that man with them?

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:43.340
He's getting away!

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:46.310
It couldn't be.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:48.740
You're the ones spying on us, right?

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:49.900
You all right?

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:51.580
Yes.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.370
Who was that man?

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:57.740
He said he wanted the negatives of
the pictures on our homepage.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:02.080
We tried to explain to him that it's digital
data, so there aren't any negatives.

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:06.710
Hey! Are you
okay?

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.260
That's a Mark II.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.130
He's changed cars.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:13.270
Nakajima! It's the robber! I'm sure of it!

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.170
Let's get him!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.360
Okay.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:16.330
Wait!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:17.970
Huh?

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:22.770
Let us help you
catch him.

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:41.460
He just ran through the intersection.
Cars all over the place.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.830
I know! He must have
run the light!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:49.470
The helicopter's at an intersection
in Kinshi Section 3.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:52.900
How long does it take
to upload a photo?

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.060
About 30
seconds.

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.840
That's a long
wait.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.340
Are you all
right?

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:06.880
Natsumi. The photo of the thief's driving
will show where he's going.

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.780
Nakajima! Keep going
straight, for now.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:12.420
Roger! Boys,
go straight!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:13.860
Roger!

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.130
Hey, don't kid around.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:17.830
Okay.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.530
All units. Requesting immediate back-up.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:26.830
Toukairin here. We're on it. Keep us
updated on the car's position.

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:34.410
Chief. Those track pants suit you.
They're a really nice color.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.920
What, this color? Yeah?
Think so?

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:41.520
Yes! You should think about
wearing them all the time.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.950
They've got to be much easier to
wear, with no zipper and all.

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:48.930
Get back to your dispatching,
you two!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.090
What's the
location?

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:55.670
Suminoe Section 3. On Kotobuki street, at
the intersection near the primary school.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.430
We'll be at a T-junction
in 30 seconds.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.800
Which way do I turn? How's
that photo coming?

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.940
Can't see the
car yet.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.880
Only fifteen seconds
left.

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:09.450
No way. It's
not ready.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.550
Left of that intersection is a new
residential development, and...

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:17.110
...on the right is a commercial and industrial
area. I'm sure he has a sense of direction.

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:19.890
What if he knows we're following
him, and he's trying to get away?

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:21.690
He'd go
right.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:26.920
He went
right!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.930
This way...
that way.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:35.370
The Bokuto human computer is
now on-line. Please wait.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:39.170
Here! This
way!

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.540
Don't bite your
tongues!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:45.950
The helicopter made a 90 degree
turn right. Are you following?!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.750
I'm right on it!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.810
I'm right on it!
Using this alley, we'll get in front of him!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:20:00.530
Oh, no! A bit
too late.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.540
There he is!

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:07.630
He won't get away! Hang on tight!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:34.370
That was great! He would
have gotten away!

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:35.940
Damn! Let me go!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:40.070
The young man gets the credit, not me.

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:43.140
It was nothing.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.780
Unreal!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.000
Cool!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.850
All right, Bokuto!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.110
Cool it!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.340
What are you so
cheeky for?

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:58.320
This whole situation was caused
by your little escapade.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:01.190
Don't you realize
that?

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:05.020
But... you're the ones who
were driving like maniacs.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:08.900
What?! Who do you think you're talking to?

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:10.630
Sorry.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:15.800
And what did you mean by those "Eyaaah"
captions under my picture?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:20.070
How could you do such a thing to a single,
eligible young lady? Well?!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:23.620
Cute remarks might be one thing on
a picture of the Chief's zipper...

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.690
...but not on my
photo! No way!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:43.330
Aah. Nothing to worry
about, now.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.930
Hmm?

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:52.170
Come on. Up you go, Mister
Zipper. Here we go again.

00:21:55.650 --> 00:22:01.850
<i>Every time I fall</i>
<i>out of love...</i>

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:09.160
<i>... everything that I see</i>
<i>turns monochrome.</i>

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:18.660
<i>We often used to go see the</i>
<i>games at the stadium...</i>

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:28.510
<i>... but the good old days mean</i>
<i>nothing to me anymore.</i>

00:22:32.520 --> 00:22:42.690
<i>Even after you've gone, I still wanna</i>
<i>tell the world what it is that I love.</i>

00:22:43.030 --> 00:22:50.970
<i>Looking up to the sky, I try</i>
<i>holding back the tears.</i>

00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:59.610
<i>Flags were moving in the wind and</i>
<i>things seemed brighter yesterday.</i>

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:07.690
<i>Looking up to the sky, we used</i>
<i>to talk about our dreams.</i>

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:17.260
<i>No matter how far out of reach they seemed,</i>
<i>dreams could come true, or so it felt.</i>

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:24.700
<i>Tell me that that fire in your</i>
<i>eyes was not a lie.</i>

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:28.300
"Watermelon"

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:30.840
In old Edo, city of
808 towns...

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.270
"Boooong..."

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:36.480
...in the middle of
the night...

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.550
"Whooo Ooooh
Eeeeh Ooooh"

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:43.350
Excuse me,
sir...

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:46.550
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 44...

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:46.790
FILE. 44
8OKUTO GHOST
STORY

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:48.590
Bokuto Ghost Story.

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:50.730
"Gyaaaaaaah!"
